WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:06.160
SCP-682 Vs SCP-017. Could the Shadow&nbsp;
Person be up to the task of finally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:10.320
consigning the Hard to Destroy Reptile&nbsp;
to eternal darkness? Let’s find out.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:15.680
The Shadow Person is a small figure, roughly the&nbsp;
size and shape of a human child, with the ability&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:21.120
to absorb other entities and make them disappear&nbsp;
by simply coming into contact with their shadows.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:26.800
It consumed a tissue sample from SCP-682&nbsp;
with no issues, so the test proceeded.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:33.520
However, during the full test, SCP-682&nbsp;
roared in horrible rage, causing SCP-017&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:39.760
to stumble and retreat back to the corner of&nbsp;
the cell. It refused to come near SCP-682.

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:44.800
To this day, it’s unclear whether the&nbsp;
sound hurt 017, or merely frightened it.

